      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "16 cores -> up to 128 arenas\n128 x 64 MiB = ~8 GiB VSZ\nYARN kills at 2.1x vmem\n\nFix: MALLOC_ARENA_MAX=4\n\"vmem explosion\"",
      "originalText": "16 cores -> up to 128 arenas\n128 x 64 MiB = ~8 GiB VSZ\nYARN kills at 2.1x vmem\n\nFix: MALLOC_ARENA_MAX=4\n\"vmem explosion\"",
